  "details": "I almost always end up opening the model when attempting to drag it into a scene or in an animation preview menu. I only seem to succeed if I quickly click and drag. Even a split second between click and drag opens the model in Windows 3D viewer. I'd like to disable \"Open\" altogether really, since I never want to use that; Unity Editor is preferred for model viewing and editing not Windows app. I've tried using Ctrl, Alt and Shift with a drag hoping it would eliminate the open behavior, no help. It's just a process of trying DOZENS of times to drag and drop just to get past that required step for avatar preparation!",
